# Wrangler / Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# Env vars — .env is currently tracked intentionally (holds only the public
# Supabase anon key), but is gitignored going forward as a safety net: if it's
# ever regenerated locally with a real secret (e.g. a service-role key added
# for local testing), that change won't be silently swept into a commit.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

